enshot 5.png", "id": "866476903069605", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623185_866476909736271_1090612464187292632_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ENvYfzolBvsQ7kNvwEy-Mpu&_nc_oc=AdpgD4RVvFmWDZHjuH7lGcL00gt3-e_PVYLWpby2hGbzYhC4xSV88VpRA5U5WKFHA5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRi_lzbFWGlRxu5-6-swrv9ByeJzAjSA85TaYY8tJf_rw&oe=6AFC8CA2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Cover Art - Meta PDP.png", "id": "1515665097254209", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623185_1515665100587542_1021055166886805700_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v8lQpTNxa3kQ7kNvwFat0-A&_nc_oc=AdqS6ELrBWOgTs0cyJorVpcZwg-nhgFxUJ5mkc-nHHcZ6QmeXWSwrrKFL0MeXNy0SME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSfiM1uNctucnRG5hV-PKbBn8QMx2hWgkS5pk1EuzpUGw&oe=6AFC90A1"}, "display_name": "Zombie Breach", "keywords": ["vrzombieshooter", "wavedefense", "survival", "horror", "crafting"], "long_description": "You're trapped on the second floor of a fortified apartment. Outside, an endless horde wants in.\nZombie Breach is a VR wave-defense shooter for Meta Quest. No story to wander through, no way out; just you, a room, and what you can hold.\n\n**TACTILE COMBAT:** Reload by hand. Eject, grab a fresh magazine from your hip, slam it home, rack the slide. Headshots hit harder and score more, the toughest zombies still take multiple clean hits.\n\n**PREP, FIGHT, LOOT:** Loot wood between waves to craft barricades for the three ways in: the front door stairwell, a crashed bus beneath the window, and a plank bridge next door. Every barricade buys time and shapes the fight. \n\n**TEN ESCALATING WAVES:** Standard zombies, fast rushers and tanks that soak damage. The horde grows faster, tougher, and more numerous each wave. Survive all ten to win, or die and chase a better score.\n\n**HEAR THEM COMING:** Every zombie type has its own groan and footstep, fully spatialized. Footsteps on the stairs, a scrape at the window; you'll hear it before you see it.\n\n**BUILT FOR COMFORT: Stable 90 FPS. Play room-scale on your feet, or seated with smooth thumbstick locomotion.** \n\nZombie Breach is Virtulane's first commercial game title, built by a small team in Canberra, Australia.", "short_description": "Locked in one room. An endless horde outside. Zombie Breach is a VR wave-defense shooter where confinement is the threat. No exploring, no escaping, just tactile gunplay and a horde you have to out-position, out-shoot, and out-barricade. Reload by hand, John Wick style. Fortify three breach points. Survive ten escalating waves of enemy you'll hear coming before you ever see it."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtulane.com.au/zb-privacypolicy#bf87ff4c-0ce8-4981-8f63-11dd193e0598", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtulane Pty Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtulane.com.au/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1600688755109966"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3137613973099188"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3137613973099188"}, "is_app